{"id":"15263910","articleId":"13364541","title":"How Are Markets Created?","description":"Markets are created by the markets team with input from users and the community.","blocks":[{"type":"subheading","text":"<br><b>Can I create my own market?</b>","idAttribute":"h_9179d76431"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"While users cannot directly create their own markets, they are encouraged to suggest ideas for new markets. ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>​Submit your market proposal</b>","idAttribute":"h_ce598236d1"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"To give your proposal the best chance of being listed, include as much information as possible, such as:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- What is the market title?\n- What is the <a href=\"https://intercom.help/polymarket/en/articles/13364518-how-are-prediction-markets-resolved\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">resolution source</a>?\n- Evidence of demand for trading that market","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is the market title?","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"What is the <a href=\"https://intercom.help/polymarket/en/articles/13364518-how-are-prediction-markets-resolved\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">resolution source</a>?","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Evidence of demand for trading that market","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The best ways to propose a new market are:","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"unorderedNestedList","text":"- On Twitter / X by tagging @polymarket","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"On Twitter / X by tagging @polymarket","class":"no-margin"}]}]}],"markdown":null,"author":null,"collectionId":"17859586","targetUserType":"everyone","lastUpdated":"Updated over 4 months ago","lastUpdatedDate":"2026-04-19T03:53:46Z","showTableOfContents":true,"synced":false,"relatedArticles":[{"title":"What is Polymarket","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364060-what-is-polymarket"},{"title":"What is a Prediction Market?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364272-what-is-a-prediction-market"},{"title":"How Are Prediction Markets Resolved?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364518-how-are-prediction-markets-resolved"},{"title":"How Are Markets Disputed?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364551-how-are-markets-disputed"}],"locale":"en","breadcrumbs":[{"url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/collections/17859586-markets","name":"Markets"}],"canonicalUrl":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364541-how-are-markets-created","selectedReaction":null,"showReactions":true}